tone: trouble
life: friends, love
horizon: days
roles: friend
earth: {friend} is going through something hard, and {N} answers with solutions
scene: {friend} rings late, crying: the marriage is over. {N} listens for a minute, then starts on lawyers, the house and the next steps. There is a long silence on the line.
scene U: Feelings pass and problems stay. {N} has always helped people by working out what to do, and it is the kindest thing {N} knows how to give.
- U | send a clear list of next steps in the morning, with the numbers to ring | v: self-direction, universalism | chance: 40
- W | promise to be there through the worst of it, and keep the promise every week | v: benevolence, conformity | mark: kept your word | chance: 62
- B | find {friend} the best lawyer you know, and call in a favour to get them seen | v: power, benevolence | mark: helped someone in need | chance: 62
- R | drive over now, with a bottle and nothing to say | v: benevolence, stimulation | chance: 66
- G | go and sit with {friend}, and let the silence be | v: benevolence | mark: helped someone in need | chance: 66
- W>R | keep your Saturdays free for {friend}, for whatever they feel like doing | v: benevolence, hedonism | chance: 58
- U>G | read up on what helps people through a break-up, and learn to just listen | v: self-direction, benevolence | mark: learned a skill | chance: 52
- B>W | take over the paperwork {friend} cannot face, so the settlement is fair | v: power, universalism | chance: 58
- R>U | admit to {friend} that comfort does not come easily, and ask what would help | v: benevolence, self-direction | chance: 62
- G>B | have {friend} to stay for a while, until they are back on their feet | v: benevolence, security | chance: 62
works: {friend} says later that {N} was the one who got them through it.
works: Something shifts between them, and the friendship is closer than before.
fails: {friend} stops ringing, and {N} hears the news from others.
fails: The advice was sound and {friend} took it, but {friend} confides in someone else now.

