horizon: years
roles: friend
earth: the stairs are getting hard, and {N} has been weighing a move for years
scene: The stairs are steeper every winter, and the garden has gone wild. {N} has kept the brochures for sheltered flats in a folder for three years, with notes in the margins, and still cannot decide.
scene U: There are seven options, each with its own drawbacks, and the costs keep changing. Deciding wrong would be worse than not deciding at all.
