# ---------------------------------------------------------------- reckless (Red)

== another night that runs into morning
tier: life event
stages: young_adult
age: 18-30
holds: reckless
per_year: 0 0 .3 0 0 0
gap: 2-5
alpha: W.3 U.3 B.15 R.1 G.15
times: an estimate: about one person in three who is reckless meets it in a year as a young adult; it comes back now and then for as long as the state holds (shadows.md)
likelier: a job with early shifts; friends who go out most nights; living in a city
rarer: a young child at home; a job that starts at noon
tone: mixed
life: friends, health, work
horizon: weeks
roles: friend, boss
earth: it is the third big night this week, and work starts at eight
scene: It is two in the morning, the third big night this week, and the party is just getting good. {N} has an early shift at eight and has already used up the last sick day.
scene R: Life is short, and nights like this do not come back. {N} can sleep when {N} is old.
- R | stay till dawn and go straight to work | v: hedonism, stimulation | self_control: - | chance: 40
- W | go home now, as you promised yourself you would | v: conformity, security | self_control: + | chance: 66
- U | set a rule: two nights a week, home by one, for a month | v: self-direction, security | self_control: + | chance: 66
- B | swap the early shift with a colleague for a favour, and stay | v: hedonism, power | self_control: - | chance: 62
- G | slip out to the garden with {friend}, talk until the sky gets light, then sleep | v: benevolence, hedonism | chance: 62
- W>G | walk {friend} home safely, and call it a night for both of you | v: benevolence, conformity | chance: 62
- U>W | add up what the nights cost in pay and sleep, and tell the group straight | v: self-direction, universalism | chance: 62
- B>U | turn the parties into a side business, and learn to run them with a clear head | v: achievement, power | self_control: + | mark: learned a skill | chance: 58
- R>B | quit the early shift tonight, by text, and find a job that starts at noon | v: self-direction, stimulation | mark: took a wild risk | chance: 52
- G>R | go swimming at dawn with whoever is still standing, then go to bed | v: hedonism, stimulation | chance: 58
works: {N} makes the shift, just, and decides that some nights are worth more than others.
works: The nights get fewer and better, and the mornings come back.
fails: {N} oversleeps, and {boss} gives the shifts to someone else.
fails: By the end of the month {N} is ill, broke and short of friends.

== the row that could end the job
tier: life event
at: employer
