- R>G | go, and come home every month for Sunday dinner | v: stimulation, tradition | chance: 58
- G>W | stay, and take on the job at the family firm that no one else wants | v: tradition, conformity | chance: 52
works: Whatever {N} chose, {N} chose it with open eyes, and it holds.
